{"id":"vod_sn_56301","vodId":"56301","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"反叛的鲁路修R2","name_cn":"反叛的鲁路修R2","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20231127-1/eb85a3251d44868db4ca309d7d6ecec8.jpg"},"summary":"“东京决战”一年后，布里塔尼亚少年鲁路修在11区（原日本国）过着平凡的学生生活。但是，鲁路修与弟弟罗洛的一次出行，遇到了黑色骑士团的余党。在与少女C.C再次结成契约之后，尘封的记忆摆在了鲁路修的面前。\r\n　　身为帝国王子的鲁路修，为了建立人人平等的世界、让妹妹娜娜丽幸福的世界，而使用GEASS，令人绝对服从的力量，带领黑色骑士团向帝国宣战。带上假面化名ZERO的他，却在一年前的“东京决战”中被好友朱雀击败，被帝国皇帝抹去了记忆。\r\n　　现在，恢复记忆的鲁路修不仅要面对帝国的强大军事力量，更要面对虚假的弟弟罗洛、失踪的妹妹娜娜丽、不知敌友的中华联盟、内部出现分歧的黑色骑士团。面对内忧外患，鲁路修走上了GEASS之力的诅咒——孤独的王之路。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-27 18:00:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/n373ehirt12/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/LnAAuGi9ae2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/Yg28Gp0rUX2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/R7Wq9C9HTE2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/FyC38PtzYg2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/R1Dr5tdka42/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/KfaHfz6rUf2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/hjXfU3xhNe2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/S2U3H4cpRz2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/NKeXaSXdsw2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/LD7sb0Nd6n2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/z04URGiKVr2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/NKTd6DkHbj2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202311/27/